# The Territory Manager and the UK territory (plans/RISCOS-EMULATOR.md
# §4.6): what the calls the PRM documents answer, in the UK's time zone.
# A text the guest writes is never recorded: Territory_Collate compares it
# in the guest with the one expected, and only its answer is kept.

scenario territory-number-and-existence
call XTerritory_Number
show r0 v
call XTerritory_Exists r0=1
show z v
call XTerritory_Exists r0=7
show z v
call XTerritory_Exists r0=0
show z v
call XTerritory_Exists r0=99
show z v

